y / mother\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">妈妈</span><span class=\"tr\">媽媽</span><rt>mā ma</rt></ruby>，<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"nǐ\" data-defn=\"you\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">你</span><span class=\"tr\">你</span><rt>nǐ</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"zhēn\" data-defn=\"really / truly / indeed\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">真</span><span class=\"tr\">真</span><rt>zhēn</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"xìng fú\" data-defn=\"happy / blessed\" data-hsk=\"HSK 4\"><span class=\"si\">幸福</span><span class=\"tr\">幸福</span><rt>xìng fú</rt></ruby>，<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"dōu\" data-defn=\"all; both; entirely\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">都</span><span class=\"tr\">都</span><rt>dōu</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"bù\" data-defn=\"no; not so\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">不</span><span class=\"tr\">不</span><rt>bù</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yòng\" data-defn=\"to need; to have to (usu. used in the negative or in questions)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span class=\"si\">用</span><span class=\"tr\">用</span><rt>yòng</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"zuò\" data-defn=\"to do; to engage in; to hold (a party etc)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">做</span><span class=\"tr\">做</span><rt>zuò</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"zuò yè\" data-defn=\"school assignment / homework\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span class=\"si\">作业</span><span class=\"tr\">作業</span><rt>zuò yè</rt></ruby>。”<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"mā ma\" data-defn=\"mama / mommy / mother\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">妈妈</span><span class=\"tr\">媽媽</span><rt>mā ma</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"huí dá\" data-defn=\"to reply; to answer / reply; answer\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">回答</span><span class=\"tr\">回答</span><rt>huí dá</rt></ruby>：“<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"nà\" data-defn=\"then (in that case)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"